stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> GenericQR: Kiosk idle / after submit or expiry

    GenericQR --> MintSap: sap.lookup.found
    GenericQR --> MintLpr: sap.lookup.not_found

    MintSap --> ActiveTicket: Redis checkin:ticket + gate key EX 180s\nplateLocked=true name+phone filled
    MintLpr --> ActiveTicket: Redis ticket EX 180s\nplateLocked=false plate only

    ActiveTicket --> PhoneLoads: Phone opens /checkin?gate=&t=
    PhoneLoads --> Prefill: GET /checkin/tickets/:token 200
    PhoneLoads --> ExpiredFallback: GET 410 Gone

    Prefill --> Submitted: POST /checkin/submit success
    Submitted --> GenericQR: Consume token; push submitted then generic

    ExpiredFallback --> GenericForm: Drop to generic form for gate\nkeep plate hint if LPR still live
    GenericForm --> Submitted: Submit without token

    ActiveTicket --> GenericQR: TTL expires / single-use consumed
    ActiveTicket --> ActiveTicket: New LPR at same gate replaces prior token
